        <tr id="comment-body-453640"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL244025https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL244025at30%2FJun%2F252%3A34PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-44025" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-44025</a> at 30/Jun/25 2:34 PM</h5>

<p>1，eks节点kubernetes目录占用高</p>

<p>2，咨询如歌定期清理（客户现场使用crictl rmi --prune定期清理）</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/361080" alt="25ec8091ca9d1632a56b6c8515855de-20250630-062412.png" height="160" width="1012" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

